<span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><br></span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uscepters/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">셉터</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> | </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uspears/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스피어</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> | </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/ustaves/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스태프</span></b></font><b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> </span></font></b></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">| </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uswords/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스워드</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> | </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uthrowing/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">던지는 \n                무기</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> |</span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uwands/\"><b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> </span></font></b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">완드</span></b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><b><font color=\"#996600\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Elite \nUniques</span></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> </span></font></b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">: </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/euweapons/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">무기</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> | </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/euarmor/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">아머</span></b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#999933\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"580\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" height=\"30\" width=\"562\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020830120137/http://forg.uospace.net:80/Diablo/sets7.shtml#sandersfolly\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#996600\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Exceptional Unique Wands\n                             \n                            </span></b></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">[익셉셔널 유니크 완드]</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"97\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img height=\"118\" src=\"/img/posts/site/Diablo/images/item/unique/wand.gif\" width=\"62\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"#908858\"><b>Suicide \nBranch</b></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Burnt Wand</span></font></p></center></td>\n<td width=\"219\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">One-Hand Damage: 8 To 18 (13 \nAvg)<br>Required Level: 33<br>Required Strength: 25<br>Durability: 15<br>Base \nWeapon Speed: [0]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">150% Damage To Undead</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+1 To All Skills</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">50% Faster Cast \nRate</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Increase Maximum Mana 10%</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">All Resistances +10</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+40 To \nLife</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Attacker Takes Damage of 25</font><br>(Only \nSpawns In Patch 1.09 or later) </span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"214\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">한손 \n                            데미지 : 8 To 18 (13 \nAvg)<br>레벨 요구치 : 33<br>힘 요구치 : 25<br>내구력 : 15<br>무기기본속도 : [0]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">150% 언데드계열에 대해 데미지 추가</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+1 모든 스킬</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">50% 매우빠른 캐스팅 속도 </font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">최대 마나 10% 증가</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">모든 저항력 +10</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+40 라이프</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">공격자가 받는 데미지 25</font><br>(Only \nSpawns In Patch 1.09 or later) </span></font> </p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"97\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img height=\"118\" src=\"/img/posts/site/Diablo/images/item/unique/maelstromwrath.gif\" width=\"62\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"#908858\"><b>Carin \nShard</b></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Petrified Wand</span></font></p></center></td>\n<td width=\"219\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">One-Hand Damage: 8 To 24 (16 \nAvg)<br>Required Level: 35<br>Required Strength: 25<br>Durability: 15<br>Base \nWeapon Speed: [10]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">150% Damage To Undead</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+ (1.25 Per Character Level) 1.25-123.75 To Mana (Based On \nCharacter Level)</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+ (1.25 Per Character Level) \n1.25-123.75 To Life (Based On Character Level)</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+1 \nTo Necromancer Skill Levels</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+2 To Summoning Skills \n(Necromancer Only)</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">10% Faster Cast \nRate</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">30% Faster Hit Recovery</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Replenish Life +5</font><br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) \n</span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"214\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">한손 \n                            데미지 : 8 To 24 (16 \nAvg)<br>레벨 요구치 : 35<br>힘 요구치 : 25<br>내구력 : 15<br>무기기본속도 : [10]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">150%언데드 계열에 대해 데미지 추가</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+ (캐릭터레벨 1.25마다) 1.25-123.75 마나 추가 (캐릭터레벨에 비례해서)</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+ (캐릭터 레벨 1.25마다) \n1.25-123.75 라이프 추가(캐릭터레벨에 비례해서)</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+1 네크로멘서 스킬</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+2 소환스킬 \n(네크로멘서 전용)</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">10% 매우 빠른 캐스팅 속도</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">30% 매우 빠른 회복 속도</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">라이프 회복력  +5</font><br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) \n</span></font> </p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"97\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; m